      "writtenOn": "2024-05-05T02:36:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This name is very confusing with `AAudioStream`. I don\u0027t think you need the `Aaudio` prefix for the items in this module, because its name already is `aaudio_streams`.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 65,
        "startChar": 7,
