        "id": 1956136
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-05-08T09:00:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I traced the crosvm audio playback code start from this [function](https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:external/crosvm/devices/src/virtio/snd/common_backend/async_funcs.rs;l\u003d347). I see every async function call ended with a await right after. Can we assume the AAudio would be called in single thread?\n\nIf we want to ensure the thread-safty for these async functions we are going to implement. AAudio provides a non-blocking [callback method](https://developer.android.com/ndk/guides/audio/aaudio/aaudio#high-priority-callback) that may solve this issue and additionally improves the performance(although the sound is kind of perfect currently). But it will become more complex as a producer/consumer problem...",
