      "message": "I didn\u0027t look into the crosvm side of this. What you said sounds like a good sign, but I feel like it\u0027s a very fragile thing for us to depend on.\n\nNot sure the callback method you mentioned makes everything thread safe all at a sudden.\n\nI feel fine with not fixing this right now, but I think we may want to revisit this in the future. Feel free to resolve this.",
